# Plan 23-05: red runs (guard mutations)

All tests of this plan passed on the first green run: plan 23-04 built the
command. Each test is a guard. Each mutation below was made, run, and undone;
`git status --short` showed only the test file after each undo.

## Task 1: round_trip_*

Command: cargo test -p slicefs-cli --test rehash_tests round_trip

### Mutation A (rehash.rs): the switch writes the old snapshot roots
`write_switch_segment(&segs, new.current, &old.snapshots)`. The GC of the run
then frees the old snapshot trees, and the walk of the live objects fails.

