### Mutation B2 (rehash/mod.rs) and mutation C (content.rs), in one run
- B2: `value()` keeps a value when its own key has the target tag, with no
  check of its tree (`old.tag() == self.target.tag()` in place of
  `self.all_target(old)`).
- C: `open_with_hasher` opens the conversion store with
  `ChunkProfile::DEFAULT`, not the header profile.

